# Candidate Patch — Worker 9 Dialog Accessibility Fix
# Base commit: d95df9e609454877a91b7c82146b3c6368181b17
# File: frontend/v2/src/main.ts
# Base hash: 00dae4e67a63641bc62625c6eda95fd1d97846f9ece3202f4ac3c8e2a1291c09
#
# Two defects addressed:
# D-ACC-01: Escape key does not close <dialog class="modal" open> elements
# D-ACC-02: Focus not returned to triggering element after dialog close
#
# Root cause: <dialog> with `open` attribute has NO modal behaviors
# (no Escape handling, no focus trapping, no backdrop click) — only showModal() activates these
#
# Fix strategy:
# 1. Track lastFocusedElement before opening any dialog
# 2. Add one global keydown handler for Escape that closes open modals
# 3. Return focus to lastFocusedElement after any dialog close
# 4. Apply to all dialog open/close handlers in bindInteractions()

